From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OddBlueDog <3959851+OddBlueDog@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:05:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: tests: firmware timeouts, MT7916 LEDs, WED
 reorder ring; staged firmware removed

- mt7915_mcu2_fw_handshake_timeouts (slow): the driver never getting
  the device, the firmware never entering its download state at a load
  or at the exit (the device then not handed back).
- mt7915_mcu2_dpd_freq_idx_mt7915: the MT7915's DPD channel list.
- mt7915_init_test_led_mux: the MT7916's single-band LED pins.
- mt76_wed_test_dma_setup_rro_ind: WED v3's reorder indication ring.
- mt76_wed_test_dma_reset_timeout (slow): WED never finishing its reset.

tests/fw-files.h removes each firmware file it wrote when the test ends:
the MT7975 images the restart tests stage made mt7915-mcu-fw-misc skip
its tests of missing firmware.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
